{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2026-06", "window": 4, "start_date": 1782259200, "end_date": 1782863999, "month_true_total": 629, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:30:25 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "229280717", "author": {"steamid": "76561199489879084", "personaname": "wrydtn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199489879084/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4429, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3743, "last_played": 1783879785, "avatar": "f535384e5389bd418546f22ae96340df1702971f"}, "language": "english", "review": "for rock and stone", "timestamp_created": 1782857869, "timestamp_updated": 1782857869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229278340", "author": {"steamid": "76561198855253215", "personaname": "the_socked_hedgehog", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198855253215/", "num_games_owned": 114, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3423, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2410, "last_played": 1783808473, "avatar": "b07e10ec3066d1f18def209da0b9378a4ce87bdb"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice game", "timestamp_created": 1782855656, "timestamp_updated": 1782855656, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229261418", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059639602", "personaname": "Raging Canuck", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198059639602/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 19568, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 385, "playtime_at_review": 16483, "deck_playtime_at_review": 16481, "last_played": 1787969155, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "My favourite game of all time. So cheap. So good.", "timestamp_created": 1782842130, "timestamp_updated": 1782842130, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229258679", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993282815", "personaname": "Error", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/awizarddidit/", "num_games_owned": 903, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 11248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 172, "playtime_at_review": 10257, "last_played": 1788032790, "avatar": "618bfa7e8477cee17e56637af632fef4e31724b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Deep Rock Galactic is a delightful take on the cooperative horde shooter. Each dwarf has both unique weapons for dealing with hordes of giant alien arthropods and unique team traversal/utility tools to get around the dark and sprawling caves generated for all the different random mission types. The progression curve is very enjoyable, with leveling up your dwarves as the initial goal and unlocking weird weapon modifications as the endgame.\r\n\r\nThe game is less opinionated than most horde shooters about how quickly you'll progress through its different difficulty levels; you still have to traverse the caves to find and mine minerals regardless of the difficulty, so there's still lots to do even if there aren't constant enemies.\r\n\r\nSince its release, the game has had so many incremental free releases that the amount of content to explore here is staggering. Thankfully, there's a pretty good in-game guide to the basics of all the missions and events.\r\n\r\nBecause the game's caves are labyrinthine and light is a limited resource, this game has a steeper learning curve than usual with regard to situational awareness. Expect to get horribly turned around and need help from your teammates until you've gotten the hang of using the in-game tools for keeping track of the map, the cardinal directions, the objectives, and your fellow dwarves.", "timestamp_created": 1782839954, "timestamp_updated": 1782839954, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229257983", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018269571", "personaname": "BA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018269571/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 19183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19183, "last_played": 1724853403, "avatar": "7427ab6bce5b13c8496e1e3275511d27da107040"}, "language": "english", "review": "So, you killed the original for the sake of a monstrosity like Rogue Core? Two soulless roguelikes, instead of new DLC and patches. Thanks, I deleted it and forgot about your company. You're literally repeating the same mistake as the creators of Killing Floor 3 and Payday 3. You're releasing a stub with no content or a good idea, trying to sell the same thing again. Thanks for the original, excellent DRG.", "timestamp_created": 1782839399, "timestamp_updated": 1782839399, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545468091964722", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}